# Build context of the pipeline images (docker/). An allowlist: everything is
# excluded, then only what the images copy is let back in, so .env, .venv,
# node_modules, tests, docs and results can never reach an image.
*
!requirements.txt
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!common/
!config/
!schemas/
!bridge/
!edge/
!broker/
!processing/alarm_consumer/
!processing/thingsboard_sink/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
